<div class="wrapper privacy-page">
  <h1 data-i18n="accessibility.heading">Accessibility Statement</h1>

  <p>{{ business.name }} <span data-i18n="accessibility.p1">is committed to making this website usable by everyone, including people who use assistive technology like a screen reader, screen magnifier, or keyboard-only navigation. This site aims to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA, and includes a skip-to-content link, labeled navigation, descriptive text on real content images, and keyboard-operable menus, forms, and interactive widgets (the photo gallery, mortgage calculator, and listing filters included).</span></p>

  <h2 data-i18n="accessibility.needHelpHeading">Should you need help</h2>
  <p><span data-i18n="accessibility.needHelpPre">If any page or feature on this site is difficult to use with the technology or approach that works for you, please don't struggle with it alone — call or text</span> {{ business.phoneCell }}, <span data-i18n="accessibility.needHelpOr">or</span> <a href="/contact/" data-i18n="accessibility.contactPageLink">reach out through the contact page</a><span data-i18n="accessibility.needHelpPost">, and Julia will help you directly or get you the information another way.</span></p>

  <h2 data-i18n="accessibility.ongoingHeading">Ongoing effort</h2>
  <p data-i18n="accessibility.ongoingBody">Accessibility is an ongoing effort, not a one-time fix. If you notice something on this site that doesn't work well with assistive technology, please let us know — that feedback is used to fix it.</p>
</div>
